 , with a quiet space and book corner on site.\nPrice: Free\nhttps://www.
 eventbrite.co.uk/e/beyond-bayeux-tapestry-now-exhibition-half-term-famil
 y-day-tickets-1993477734567?aff=erelpanelorg
