SUMMARY:Tour: Memorials and memory
DESCRIPTION:Explore national memory via memorial stones\, windows and scu
 lptures across the Abbey. Stops include Poets' Corner\, the Lady Chapel 
 and the Nave's Grave of the Unknown Warrior.\nPrice: £11.55 (including 
 £1.55 booking fee)\nhttps://www.westminster-abbey.org/abbey-events/spec
 ial-tours-and-events/2026/october/tour-memorials-and-memory
LOCATION:The Abbey\, London
URL:https://www.westminster-abbey.org/abbey-events/special-tours-and-even
 ts/2026/october/tour-memorials-and-memory
