SUMMARY:Family Autumn Neurodiverse Clay Pumpkin Making
DESCRIPTION:Observe the textures and patterns of pumpkins and squash\, th
 en make your own from air dry clay and acrylic paint. Designed for famil
 ies with neurodiverse needs.\nPrice: Free\nhttps://www.gardenmuseum.org.
 uk/whats-on/family-october-half-term-neurodiverse-clay-pumpkin-making/
LOCATION:Garden Museum\, London
URL:https://www.gardenmuseum.org.uk/whats-on/family-october-half-term-neu
 rodiverse-clay-pumpkin-making/
